## YouTube Factory Analysis
- **CPU**: Joonggonara 2 (i7-14700K) is the clear winner for bots/profiles (20 cores vs 16 cores).
- **RAM**: Joonggonara 1 (32GB) is best out-of-the-box. Mangwol-dong/Joonggonara 2 (16GB) need upgrades.
- **GPU**: Mangwol-dong has the strongest GPU (4070), but CPU/RAM are more important for this use case.

## Conclusion
Mangwol-dong is indeed "falling behind" (밀리고 있음). It is the most expensive but has fewer CPU cores than Joonggonara 2 and less RAM than Joonggonara 1. 

**Definitive Recommendation**: Buy **Joonggonara 2 (228244891)** and use the 200,000 KRW savings to upgrade the RAM to 64GB. This will maximize performance for browser profiles and bots.
